# Lure of the Wildcat (Jeuno) (jeuno 90): utils.mask.isFull(Prog, 20), its edges set by a GM. Accepted with the badge:
# Prog 0x7FFFF (bit 19 missing, 524287): 10090; 0xFFFFE (bit 0 missing, 1048574): 10090; 0x1FFFFF (all twenty and bit
# 20, 2097151): 10091 (isFull reads the low 20 bits), finished: completed. After an Event the lookup tries his script
# first (UseFallback); it starts nothing without the ToAU mission, so the quest's action plays each time.
lists UpperJeuno/Ajithaam/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/10091
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-79.7,0,161.5 job=WAR lvl=20
quest Jeuno.LureOfTheWildcat accepted
keyitem WhiteSentinelBadge
charvar Quest[3][90]Prog 524287
login
trigger Ajithaam               # bit 19 missing: 10090
finish
charvar Quest[3][90]Prog 1048574 # a GM: bit 0 missing
trigger Ajithaam               # 10090
finish
charvar Quest[3][90]Prog 2097151 # a GM: the low twenty bits and bit 20
trigger Ajithaam               # isFull: 10091 (Progress: no alternation)
finish                         # the badge taken, KEYITEM_LOST, completed: the White Invitation Card
